---

This jar does nothing alone. You need all of these on NeoForge 1.21.1:

- Iron’s Spells ’n Spellbooks
- Ars Nouveau
- [Spell Codex](/mods/spell-codex)
- [Spell Actionbar](/mods/spell-actionbar)
- this compat

Craft a caster tome the Ars way. Craft the **Spell Conversion Station**. Convert the tome. Open Codex, find the **Ars Nouveau** tab, put the new card on the action bar.

Addon tomes (extra Ars schools from other mods) count if they use the normal `ars_nouveau:caster_tome` recipe. You do not make a list. If the tome crafts like a vanilla Ars tome, the station will see it.
